    "detailed_description": "<strong>Oh no!</strong> The light's green and it's time to race, but you're the only one who showed up to the starting line! No time for sad faces, go find all your friends so we can get this party started! Don't be scared now, the fun's just begun!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940460/extras/1d5f218b169cff86f66ecfe316c0631a.poster.avif?t=1743868368\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940460/extras/1d5f218b169cff86f66ecfe316c0631a.webm?t=1743868368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940460/extras/1d5f218b169cff86f66ecfe316c0631a.mp4?t=1743868368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>WELCOME TO KITTY KART 64! </strong><br>Explore scrapped tracks, beta maps, and dreamscapes in a chaotic, broken world, all from the convenience of your go-kart! Drive, collect secrets, and break out of bounds to explore an interconnected open world. Learn how to bend the game to your will, and make it break.<br><strong><br>What will you find that you weren\u2019t meant to see?</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940460/extras/7e1ee98b437f1b271c3952075badac24.poster.avif?t=1743868368\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940460/extras/7e1ee98b437f1b271c3952075badac24.webm?t=1743868368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940460/extras/7e1ee98b437f1b271c3952075badac24.mp4?t=1743868368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong><br>FULL OF FEATURES!</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Race your way through dozens of unique tracks!<br></li><li>A unique cast of cute characters!<br></li><li>Make new friends (or rivals) on the raceway!<br></li><li>Stunning 3D graphics!<br></li><li>Hours and hours of fun!</li></ul>",
